--- !u!114 &1156190515
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1156190514}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9ff8bef94688c4cec8618fe026be84a1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SurfPool.StoryScreen
  letter: 'Hey kiddo,


    If you''re reading this, the wave pool is yours now. I built it with my own hands thirty years ago. It''s a bit run-down these days, the paint is peeling and the machine only makes little whitewater waves... but the magic is still there.


    Start small: sell sessions at the ticket desk and send waves for the beginners. Save every dollar, fix the place up, and one day this could be the best surf park in the world.


    I left you some notes along the way. Follow them.'
